<title>ISRAEL: Police reduce Jerusalem death toll to 13.</title>
<headline>Police reduce Jerusalem death toll to 13.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israeli police said two suicide bombers killed 11 people on Wednesday in an attack on a Jerusalem street market.</p>
<p>A police spokesman, who earlier put the death toll at 18, said: &quot;Eleven people were killed and two suicide terrorists (a total of 13 dead) and 157 wounded were taken to various hospitals.&quot;</p>
</text>
